[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - B is the perturbed node, so B is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - B is a direct downstream of itself (no parent), so B is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - D is a downstream of B (B->D), so D is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - A is a downstream of D (D->A), so A is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - C is not a downstream of B (no path from B to C), so C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m Thus, the result is: A:1, B:0, C:0, D:1.
