[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - B is a downstream of C (C->B), so B is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - D is a downstream of B (B->D), so D is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - A is a downstream of D (D->A), so A is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m Thus, the result is: A:1, B:1, C:0, D:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m **Perturb(D):**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3096049)[0m - D is the perturbed node, so D is 0.
